{"hymn":"S741","parent":"E1285","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"La fe que transmitida fue","subtitle":"La guerra espiritual—Guardar el depósito","syl":{"n1":"La","n2":"fe","n3":"que","n4":["trans","i"],"n6":["mi","m"],"n8":["ti","m"],"n9":["da","t"],"n10":"fue","n11":"A","n12":["san","i"],"n13":["tos","t"],"n14":"del","n16":["a","i"],"n18":["yer,","t"],"n19":"Hoy","n20":"a","n21":["no","i"],"n22":["so","m"],"n24":["tros","t"],"n26":"se","n27":["con","i"],"n28":["fió,","t"],"n29":["Pa","i"],"n30":["ra","t"],"n31":["guar","i"],"n32":["dar","m"],"n34":["la","t"],"n36":"fiel.","n37":"Y","n38":["sa","i"],"n39":["be","m"],"n40":["mos","t"],"n41":"en","n42":"quien","n43":["cre","i"],"n44":["í","m"],"n45":["mos,","t"],"n46":"Que","n47":"Él","n48":"es","n49":"fiel","n50":"y","n51":"es","n52":["po","i"],"n53":["de","m"],"n54":["ro","m"],"n55":["so","t"],"n56":"En","n57":["guar","i"],"n58":["dar","t"],"n59":["lo‿en","i"],"n60":["co","m"],"n61":["men","m"],"n62":["da","m"],"n63":["do","t"],"n64":"Por","n65":"Su","n66":["san","i"],"n67":["to‿Es","m"],"n68":["pí","m"],"n69":["ri","m"],"n70":["tu.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Hoy este buen depósito","El objeivo es","De la esconomía de Dios,","Y Su recobro fiel."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["La fe común requiere hoy","Conciencia pura hallar,","Y un vivir para el Señor","Que sea con santidad."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Palabras sanas, en amor","Y en fe hay que guardar;","Mas enseñanzas de error,","Con fuerza rechazad."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["¡Oh, las palabras sanas son","Verdad de la piedad!","La fe, el buen depósito,","Y vida en santidad."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Oh, haznos fieles en pasar","Lo que se oyó, Señor;","Ejemplos en espíritu,","Palabra, fe y amor."]}]}